    "detailed_description": "VR driver school, designed specifically for the re conception and redesign of virtual reality. The game has just been launched and has become a driving school specific simulator software, perfectly restoring the driving school learning environment and making real-time judgments.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supports two types of left and right rudders and related traffic rules around the world</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759810/extras/6c268298d8b2c368f6fbf6bff54290ea.avif?t=1722916354\" width=370 height=134 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Including two models: C1 manual and C2 automatic.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759810/extras/49487316da52c43f549fa8b8360175d1.avif?t=1722916354\" width=376 height=134 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supports two modes of VR joystick and steering wheel control</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759810/extras/d6d6b9d0e706c7781c0826cd4b3c4ac0.avif?t=1722916354\" width=600 height=172 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete set of subjects 2</h2>: reverse parking, side parking, curve driving, right angle turning, designated parking on slopes, and driving practice and simulation exams for starting<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759810/extras/df43c64cb108275fe59f04f3f3874ccd.avif?t=1722916354\" width=600 height=134 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete set of subjects</h2>: starting, shifting, right turn, left turn, lane changing, turning, overtaking, meeting, pulling over, passing public transportation, school, sidewalk, and mock exams<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759810/extras/40b9870414a82e8d26727ed9ad0a18ab.avif?t=1722916354\" width=600 height=446 /></span><br>Super realistic venue simulation! Real time simulation exams, non-invasive virtual environments, don't worry about hitting anything, go ahead and take it!",
